# Each round's layout (game/arena.h): the blocks standing inside the square. Film it with
# tests\e2e\film_round.ps1 -Round N (2 the donut, 3 the pillars, 4 the four rooms, 5 the square
# closing in), which builds the game booting into that round. The loop's broken (as
# arrival.steps) so the flight down shows the whole arena from above as its walls and blocks
# rise, then 1st person at the layout's start, looking right, then iso, then a few seconds on.
wait_boot # the opening flight is up
# Hurry it to x3: it lands in about 3 s
press b
wait 5.5
press left
wait 0.6
press left
wait 0.6
press left
wait 0.7
shot layout_0_overview_rising
wait 0.4
shot layout_1_overview
wait 2.5
shot layout_2_ahead
hold r 0.8
shot layout_3_look_right
press down
wait 0.5
shot layout_4_iso
press down
wait 6
shot layout_5_later
